vec3 hit_light(vec3 hp, vec3 n, float t) { return sky_light() + hit_sun(hp, n, t); }
// The share of the sky a hit at hp (normal n) sees: 8 rays of up to 6 m, cosine-weighted, in directions fixed to the
// normal (the same each frame: no flicker). Under a ledge or a rail, in a corner, the shade is darker, as the game's.
